OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BLegendary Irish League manager Coyle   
OL,5,Bdies aged 80                           
OL,6,GRoy Coyle, the most successful manager 
OL,7,Gin Irish League history, has died at   
OL,8,Gthe age of 80.                         
OL,10,FCoyle won 13 league titles during his  
OL,11,F32-year managerial career, achieving   
OL,12,Fperiods of sustained success with      
OL,13,FLinfield and Glentoran.                
OL,15,FHe also managed Ards, Derry City and   
OL,16,FNewry City and had a spell as          
OL,17,FGlentoran director of football.        
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
