OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,B'No-one is going to break us' -        
OL,5,Bdefiant Boks face Ireland without      
OL,6,BErasmus                                
OL,7,GAlready circled as one of the must-see 
OL,8,Gfixtures in a packed November          
OL,9,Gschedule, interest in the meeting      
OL,10,Gbetween Ireland and South Africa has   
OL,11,Gintensified following their            
OL,12,Gcontrasting disciplinary fortunes in   
OL,13,Grecent days.                           
OL,15,FNot for the first time, Springboks     
OL,16,Fhead coach Rassie Erasmus landed       
OL,17,Fhimself in hot water with the powers-  
OL,18,Fthat-be for criticising match          
OL,19,Fofficials.                             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
