OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BNI ready for 'massive' Gibraltar       
OL,5,Bdouble-header                          
OL,6,GNorthern Ireland netball head coach    
OL,7,GSheonah Forbes says their double-      
OL,8,Gheader against Gibraltar is "massive"  
OL,9,Gas they build towards next year's      
OL,10,GWorld Cup.                             
OL,12,FThe Warriors booked their spot at the  
OL,13,F2027 tournament in Australia in        
OL,14,FSeptember after impressive qualifying  
OL,15,Fwins over Wales and Republic of        
OL,16,FIreland.                               
OL,18,FThey now take on Gibraltar on Saturday 
OL,19,Fat 13:00 GMT and Sunday at 12:30 GMT   
OL,20,Fat the Antrim Forum, with both games   
OL,21,Flive on BBC iPlayer and BBC Sport      
OL,22,Fwebsite.                          G4/4 
